<title>INDIA: India RBI to approve loans under $3.0 mln scheme.</title>
<headline>India RBI to approve loans under $3.0 mln scheme.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) on Wednesday said Indian firms would have to apply to the RBI for raising foreign currency loans under the &quot;Foreign Currency - $3.0 million Scheme.&quot;</p>
<p>Application forms are available at RBI regional offices, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Approvals under this scheme were given by the federal ministry of finance until now, the RBI said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
